  "published": "2026-07-27T05:43:24.28Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds CC033: flags a CancellationTokenSource field the declaring type creates and never disposes. A source owns a timer and a registration list for the lifetime of its owner, and an undisposed linked source stays attached to its parent callback list, so a long-lived parent accumulates every child ever created. Complements CC014, which covers locals and can offer a using fix; a field is a design change, so CC033 is analyzer-only. Fires only when the type creates the source — injected, escaping, disposed, and static fields stay quiet. 33 diagnostics.",
